 *   - Arrow keys: move crosshair cursor (snapped to 20px grid)
 *   - ENTER: place selected component at cursor
 *   - BACK/AC on grid: focus toolbar
 *   - BACK/AC on toolbar: return to menu
 *   - F1-F4/1-7: select toolbar tool
