@apii{0,0,-}

Returns the current hook function.

}

@APIEntry{int lua_gethookcount (lua_State *L);|
@apii{0,0,-}

Returns the current hook count.

}

@APIEntry{int lua_gethookmask (lua_State *L);|
@apii{0,0,-}

Returns the current hook mask.

