}

@APIEntry{char *luaL_prepbuffsize (luaL_Buffer *B, size_t sz);|
@apii{?,?,m}

Returns an address to a space of size @id{sz}
where you can copy a string to be added to buffer @id{B}
@seeC{luaL_Buffer}.
